---
---
<div class="vignette-grid">
    <div class="vignette-content">
        <p class="kicker">COLLECTED SINCE 2023</p>
        <h2 class="title">A place for ideas with character.</h2>
        <p class="description">
            Thoughtful curation meets builder instinct. Each concept is treated like a rare artifact, not a commodity.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="vignette-frame">
        <div class="stripe"></div>
        <div class="frame-content">
            <p class="note-label">SHELF NOTE</p>
            <p class="note-body">"Builds feel best when they are curated, not rushed."</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .vignette-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
        gap: var(--spacing-large);
        align-items: center;
        margin-bottom: var(--spacing-large);
    }
    .vignette-frame {
        background: var(--ag-surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--ag-border);
        padding: var(--spacing-medium);
        border-radius: var(--effect-radius-medium);
        position: relative;
        transform: translate(10px, -10px);
        box-shadow: var(--effect-shadow-panel);
    }
    .stripe {
        height: 10px;
        background: var(--asset-stripe-domestic);
        border-radius: 999px;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .kicker {
        font-family: var(--typography-font-family-mono);
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        color: var(--ag-accent);
        letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    }
    .title {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;
    }
    .note-label {
        font-family: var(--typography-font-family-mono);
        font-size: 0.6rem;
        opacity: 0.6;
    }
    .note-body {
        font-family: var(--typography-font-family-display);
        font-style: italic;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .vignette-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
</style>
